OL,3,ADR Congo says military aircraft missing
OL,4,Aas rebels claim to shoot down plane
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour people were reportedly on board,
OL,7,Fincluding a Ugandan and a South African
OL,8,Fpilot, who is said to have been
OL,9,Fcaptured alive.
